#. type: Title ==
#: docs/zfr.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:54
msgid ""
"*zfr* is the command-line tool for the *zephyr* template collection.  It "
"ships language templates for small command-line utilities and helpers to "
"instantiate and manage them."
msgstr ""
"*zfr* 是 *zephyr* 模板集合的命令列工具。它提供小型命令列程式的語言模板，以及"
"例項化與管理這些工程的輔助命令。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:60
msgid ""
"*Important:* instantiated projects are expected to keep calling *zfr* (for "
"example *zfr version* in *meson.build* and *rpm/Makefile*).  The string "
"*zfr* is *not* a create/rename magic token and is never rewritten to the "
"project name. The template placeholder that *is* rewritten remains *zephyr* "
"(and *some_puff1* for sample puffs)."
msgstr ""
"*重要：* 例項化後的工程應繼續呼叫 *zfr*（例如 *meson.build* 與 *rpm/"
"Makefile* 中的 *zfr version*）。字串 *zfr* *不是* create/rename 的魔法替換"
"詞，絕不會被改寫成工程名。會被改寫的模板佔位符仍是 *zephyr* （示例 puff 為 "
"*some_puff1*）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:62
msgid "Typical workflow:"
msgstr "典型流程："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:64
msgid "Create a project from a language template:"
msgstr "從語言模板建立工程："

#. type: delimited block -
#: docs/zfr.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "zfr create -l python myproj\n"
msgstr "zfr create -l python myproj\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:70
msgid "Enter the project and add application *puffs* (example apps):"
msgstr "進入工程並新增應用 *puff*（示例程式）："

#. type: delimited block -
#: docs/zfr.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd myproj\n"
"zfr add myapp another_app\n"
msgstr ""
"cd myproj\n"
"zfr add myapp another_app\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:77
msgid ""
"Optionally rename the project or remove puffs later with *rename* / *remove*."
msgstr "之後可用 *rename* / *remove* 重新命名工程或刪除 puff。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:83
msgid ""
"Templates live under */usr/share/zephyr/<lang>/* when installed, or the "
"source tree when running an uninstalled builddir wrapper such as *build/zfr* "
"(*ZFR_PKGDATADIR* overrides). Each template may include a sample puff named "
"*some_puff1*; pass puff names on the *create* command line to instantiate "
"them, or omit them for an empty project."
msgstr ""
"安裝後模板位於 */usr/share/zephyr/<lang>/*；使用未安裝的構建目錄封裝（如 "
"*build/zfr*）時則使用原始碼樹（可用 *ZFR_PKGDATADIR* 覆蓋）。每個模板可包含名"
"為 *some_puff1* 的示例 puff；在 *create* 命令列給出 puff 名稱即可例項化它們，"
"省略則得到空工程。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:87
msgid ""
"In a monorepo, *repodir* is the git (or meta) checkout root and *packagedir* "
"is the package tree that has zephyr shape (for example *repodir/bash*).  "
"Commands that walk from the current directory resolve *packagedir* first."
msgstr ""
"在單體倉中，*repodir* 是 git（或元倉庫）檢出根目錄，*packagedir* 是具有 "
"zephyr shape 的軟體包樹（例如 *repodir/bash*）。從當前目錄向上查詢的命令會優"
"先解析 *packagedir*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "*i18n*"
msgstr "*i18n*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:95
msgid ""
"Zephyr style recommends gettext coverage for at least: *ar*, *bn*, *de*, "
"*es*, *fr*, *hi*, *id*, *it*, *ja*, *ko*, *pt*, *ru*, *sv*, *ta*, *te*, "
"*th*, *tr*, *ur*, *vi*, *zh_CN*, *zh_TW* (aliases *zh-cn* / *zh-tw*). "
"English (*en*) is the source *msgid* language and is not listed in *po/"
"LINGUAS*. List those locales in *po/LINGUAS* and ship matching *po/"
"<locale>.po* files."
msgstr ""
"Zephyr 風格建議 gettext 至少覆蓋：*ar*、*bn*、*de*、*es*、*fr*、*hi*、*id*、"
"*it*、*ja*、*ko*、*pt*、*ru*、*sv*、*ta*、*te*、*th*、*tr*、*ur*、*vi*、"
"*zh_CN*、*zh_TW*（別名 *zh-cn* / *zh-tw*）。英語（*en*）是源 *msgid* 語言，不"
"列入 *po/LINGUAS*。請在 *po/LINGUAS* 中列出這些語言，並提供對應的 *po/"
"<locale>.po* 檔案。"

#. type: Title ==
#: docs/zfr.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "命令"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "*create*"
msgstr "*create*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:109
msgid ""
"Copy *pkgdatadir/<lang>/* into a new directory *./<project_name>/* (fails if "
"the directory already exists). Rewrite *zephyr* → *_PROJECT_NAME_* and, when "
"puff names are given, *some_puff1* → the first *_PUFF_NAME_* (further names "
"via *add*). With no puff names, drop the template puff files but keep the "
"*some_puff1* tokens so a later *add* can instantiate them.  Writes a fresh "
"*debian/changelog* (template changelog is discarded) using *--"
"distribution* / *--init-version* / *--author* / *--email*, then runs *git "
"init*, sets *core.hooksPath* to *.githooks* (copies *pre-commit* so "
"*VERSION* stays in sync with *debian/changelog*), an initial commit, and an "
"annotated tag *vVER*."
msgstr ""
"把 *pkgdatadir/<lang>/* 複製到新目錄 *./<project_name>/*（若目錄已存在則失"
"敗）。把 *zephyr* 改寫為 *_PROJECT_NAME_*；若給出 puff 名稱，把 *some_puff1* "
"改寫為第一個 *_PUFF_NAME_*（其餘名稱用 *add*）。未給出 puff 名稱時刪除模板 "
"puff 檔案，但保留 *some_puff1* 標記以便稍後 *add*。用 *--distribution* / *--"
"init-version* / *--author* / *--email* 寫入新的 *debian/changelog*（丟棄模板 "
"changelog），然後 *git init*，把 *core.hooksPath* 設為 *.githooks*（複製 "
"*pre-commit*，使 *VERSION* 與 *debian/changelog* 同步），做初次提交，並打註釋"
"標籤 *vVER*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:110
#, no-wrap
msgid "*rename*"
msgstr "*rename*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:114
msgid ""
"In the current project directory, rewrite *zephyr* → *_PROJECT_NAME_* and, "
"for each given name, rewrite the template puff *some_puff1* → that name.  "
"Does not rewrite *zfr*."
msgstr ""
"在當前工程目錄中，把 *zephyr* 改寫為 *_PROJECT_NAME_*，並把模板 puff "
"*some_puff1* 改寫為每個給定名稱。不改寫 *zfr*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:115
#, no-wrap
msgid "*add*"
msgstr "*add*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:119
msgid ""
"Detect the project language and copy the template puff files into the "
"current project, renaming *some_puff1* to each given *_PUFF_NAME_*. Updates "
"Meson lists (or equivalent wiring) when possible."
msgstr ""
"檢測工程語言，把模板 puff 檔案複製到當前工程，並將 *some_puff1* 重新命名為每"
"個給定的 *_PUFF_NAME_*。儘可能更新 Meson 列表（或等價接線）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "*remove*"
msgstr "*remove*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:123
msgid ""
"Remove files and Meson wiring for each given puff name from the current "
"project."
msgstr "從當前工程刪除每個給定 puff 名稱對應的檔案與 Meson 接線。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:124
#, no-wrap
msgid "*detect*"
msgstr "*detect*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:127
msgid ""
"Print the detected language for the current directory (walks parent "
"directories to find the project root)."
msgstr "列印當前目錄檢測到的語言（向上查詢工程根目錄）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "*about*"
msgstr "*about*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:138
msgid ""
"Print information about the current project. Walks from the current "
"directory toward parents to find the project root (*meson.build* with "
"*project()* or *debian/control*). Common fields (name, version, license, "
"homepage, maintainer, summary, section, priority, distribution, "
"architecture) are parsed from Debian or RPM metadata and wrapped to the "
"terminal width. Also prints source file/line counts and an estimated payload "
"size. Interactive terminals use CSR (console SGR) colors unless *NO_COLOR* "
"is set. Use *-d* / *-r* for a full parsed Debian or RPM view (not a dump of "
"the packaging files)."
msgstr ""
"列印當前工程資訊。從當前目錄向上查詢工程根（含 *project()* 的 *meson.build* "
"或 *debian/control*）。常見欄位（名稱、版本、許可證、主頁、維護者、摘要、"
"section、priority、發行版、架構）從 Debian 或 RPM 元資料解析，並按終端寬度換"
"行。同時列印原始檔/行數與估算載荷大小。互動式終端使用 CSR（控制檯 SGR）著色，"
"除非設定了 *NO_COLOR*。用 *-d* / *-r* 檢視完整解析的 Debian 或 RPM 檢視（不是"
"打包檔案的原文轉儲）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "*version*"
msgstr "*version*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:144
msgid ""
"Print the current project version (one line, for scripts). Default is *git "
"describe* when *git* and *.git* are available, otherwise the latest *debian/"
"changelog* version. Falls back to a *VERSION* file, then *0.0.0*.  A non-"
"semver token (for example a git hash) is wrapped as *0.0.0-<token>*."
msgstr ""
"列印當前工程版本（一行，供指令碼使用）。若有 *git* 與 *.git*，預設用 *git "
"describe*，否則用最新 *debian/changelog* 版本。再回退到 *VERSION* 檔案，然後"
"是 *0.0.0*。非 semver 記號（例如 git 雜湊）會包成 *0.0.0-<token>*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:145
#, no-wrap
msgid "*lint*"
msgstr "*lint*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:158
msgid ""
"Validate the current project against zephyr packaging and layout style "
"(walks from the current directory toward parents to find the project root).  "
"Reports missing files, identity mismatches, Meson/Debian/RPM mistakes, "
"leftover *zephyr* / *some_puff1* tokens in instantiated apps, and suggested "
"fixes. Mentions of *zfr* are expected and are not treated as leftovers.  For "
"*.githooks/pre-commit*, walks up to *.git*, honors *core.hooksPath*, and "
"checks that the hook syncs *VERSION* from *debian/changelog*.  When *po/* is "
"present, warns if *LINGUAS* does not cover the recommended gettext locale "
"set (see *i18n* under Description).  Output is meant for humans and AI "
"coders: each finding has a code, path, and a concrete fix. Interactive "
"terminals use CSR (console SGR)  colors unless *NO_COLOR* is set."
msgstr ""
"按 zephyr 打包與佈局風格檢查當前工程（從當前目錄向上查詢工程根）。報告缺檔"
"案、標識不一致、Meson/Debian/RPM 問題、例項化應用中殘留的 *zephyr* / "
"*some_puff1* 標記，以及修改建議。出現 *zfr* 是預期行為，不視為殘留。對於 "
"*.githooks/pre-commit*，向上找到 *.git*，遵循 *core.hooksPath*，並檢查該鉤子"
"是否從 *debian/changelog* 同步 *VERSION*。若存在 *po/*，而 *LINGUAS* 未覆蓋推"
"薦 gettext 語言集，則發出警告（見描述中的 *i18n*）。輸出面向人類與 AI 編碼助"
"手：每條發現都有程式碼、路徑和具體修復。互動式終端使用 CSR（控制檯 SGR）著"
"色，除非設定了 *NO_COLOR*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:159
#, no-wrap
msgid "*shape*"
msgstr "*shape*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:166
msgid ""
"Print a 0–100 *zephyr shape* score for the current *packagedir* (how "
"completely the tree matches zephyr packaging style). In a monorepo the "
"*packagedir* may differ from the *repodir* (git / meta root); tools use "
"shape to prefer the package directory over the repository root.  *\\-b* / *--"
"bool* prints *1* if the score is at least the threshold (default *50*), "
"otherwise *0*."
msgstr ""
"列印當前 *packagedir* 的 0–100 *zephyr shape* 分數（目錄與 zephyr 打包風格的"
"吻合程度）。在單體倉中 *packagedir* 可能不同於 *repodir*（git / 元倉庫根）；"
"工具用 shape 優先選擇軟體包目錄而非倉庫根。*\\-b* / *--bool* 在分數不低於閾值"
"（預設 *50*）時列印 *1*，否則列印 *0*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:167
#, no-wrap
msgid "*dist*"
msgstr "*dist*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:176
msgid ""
"Build a source archive of the current project (walks from the current "
"directory toward parents to find the project root). When this directory is "
"the git project root, run *meson dist* (after *meson setup*, default *--"
"allow-dirty* and *--no-tests*). Nested language templates have no *.git* of "
"their own, so *meson dist* would pack the parent meta-repo; those trees get "
"a directory tarball of this project only. Prints the archive path on stdout. "
"*rpm/Makefile* *dist* and the Meson *srcdist* ninja target reuse this "
"command."
msgstr ""
"為當前工程構建原始碼歸檔（從當前目錄向上查詢工程根）。若本目錄就是 git 工程"
"根，則執行 *meson dist*（先 *meson setup*，預設 *--allow-dirty* 與 *--no-"
"tests*）。巢狀的語言模板沒有自己的 *.git*，*meson dist* 會打包上層元倉庫；這"
"些樹只打包當前工程目錄。在標準輸出列印歸檔路徑。*rpm/Makefile* 的 *dist* 與 "
"Meson 的 *srcdist* ninja 目標複用此命令。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:177
#, no-wrap
msgid "*release*"
msgstr "*release*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:183
msgid ""
"Parse the same options as *gh-makerelease*(1), rebuild argv, and *exec* *gh-"
"makerelease* from PATH. This command does not implement tagging, packaging, "
"or GitHub uploads itself. The *zephyr* project is released from the git "
"checkout root (language templates plus *zfr/*). See *Options for release* "
"below."
msgstr "解析與 *gh-makerelease*(1) 相同的選項，重組參數並從 PATH *exec* *gh-makerelease*。本命令自身不實作打標籤、打包或 GitHub 上傳。*zephyr* 專案從 git 檢出根目錄發布（語言模板加上 *zfr/*）。參見下文 *release 的選項*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:184
#, no-wrap
msgid "*ize*"
msgstr "*ize*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:196
msgid ""
"Refactor the current project in place so it matches current zephyr style "
"(walks from the current directory toward parents). Copies missing *debian/* "
"and *rpm/* scaffolding from the language template (names rewritten to this "
"project), writes *VERSION* and *.githooks/pre-commit*, patches *meson.build* "
"(*zfr version*, *asciidoctor* man targets, *run_target look*, bash-"
"completion install). Converts groff *\\*.1* man pages under the project (not "
"*debian/*) into *docs/\\*.adoc* with Meson rules, and turns hardcoded "
"changelog versions in *src/* into *\\*.in* *@VERSION@* substitutions or "
"*PROJECT_VERSION* via *config.h* for C family languages. *\\-n* / *--dry-"
"run* prints the plan without writing.  Afterward run *zfr lint*."
msgstr ""
"就地重構當前工程以符合現行 zephyr 風格（從當前目錄向上查詢）。從語言模板複製"
"缺失的 *debian/* 與 *rpm/* 腳手架（名稱改寫為本工程），寫入 *VERSION* 與 "
"*.githooks/pre-commit*，修補 *meson.build*（*zfr version*、*asciidoctor* 手冊"
"目標、*run_target look*、bash 補全安裝）。把工程內（不含 *debian/*）的 groff "
"*\\*.1* 手冊轉成帶 Meson 規則的 *docs/\\*.adoc*，並把 *src/* 中寫死的"
